Indented colon-fence blocks stay literal

```
 :::
 A box.
 :::
.
<div>
  <p>A box.</p>
</div>
```

```
 ::: |
 Roses,
 Violets.
 :::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>Roses,<br>
Violets.</p>
</div>
```

```
 ::: note
 Body.
 :::
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <p>Body.</p>
</aside>
```

```
:::
A box.
:::
.
<div>
  <p>A box.</p>
</div>
```
